{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/xbj1nh","slideIndex":0,"text":"1 实验与上下文问题\n数据为同三个历史种子的启发式、千问与Codex单航点方案，并非最新短航迹组。过火均值553.6667/533/445.3333；445.3333相对553.6667降低19.5665%。同Actor argmax、目标/充电协议、600步，Codex每20步自行决策。3种子为探索性结果。千问也有全量快照和最近5次决策，不能称其无上下文。完整10对中千问反而较差，不能推广所有大模型胜过启发式。\n来源：research_outputs/comprehensive_comparison_3seeds_20261022/analysis.json、report.md；research_outputs/brain_comparison_20261022_recovered/report.md。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/ehxpi5","slideIndex":1,"layout":{"id":"ly/d4ji10rm","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 2","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/mto3u507","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":0,"top":0,"width":1280,"height":720},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"02-architecture"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ehxpi5","slideIndex":1,"text":"2 系统结构\n现有task_spec确定性编码目标条件，与状态构成355维观测，Actor输出9种离散动作。评分LLM和RAG闭环为拟研究内容，非已部署功能。底层权重冻结；不采用参考图的任务嵌入网络与双Q结构。充电保护依然有效。\n来源：lowlevel/task_spec.py、obs_builder.py、webapp/route_converter.py、charge_protocol.py。"}
